<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-056" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-056-appraisal">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　評曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0005" ref="oix_a6t_ovk">朱治</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0008" ref="908_816_219">呂範</persName>以舊臣任用，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0016" ref="tut_0t1_tb8">朱然</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0019" ref="cgf_n3i_i5g">朱桓</persName>以勇烈著聞，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0027" ref="0fp_euq_upj">呂據</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0030" ref="r7q_ie6_ud9">朱異</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0033" ref="cfb_d3e_1b8">施績</persName>咸有將領之才，克紹堂構。若<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0048" ref="908_816_219">範</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0050" ref="cgf_n3i_i5g">桓</persName>之越隘，得以吉終，至於<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0062" ref="0fp_euq_upj">據</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-056-appraisal:line075:m0064" ref="r7q_ie6_ud9">異</persName>無此之尤而反罹殃者，所遇之時殊也。</p>
</text>
